    "document": "Combat Patrol",
    "section": "01. Combat Patrol Mission Sequence",
    "ruleNumber": "01.05",
    "summary": "Make a private list of which units start inside which Transports, which start in strategic reserves, which leader units join which bodyguard units, and which one of your enhancements you will take. Then exchange lists. At most half the Combat Patrol’s units can begin in reserve. Units set aside through a Combat Patrol’s own reserve provision still use this allowance. Identify the Patrol’s Warlord by that model’s Warlord keyword.",
